#NEXUS

[ gasca2015a_fig7: Ornithopod tree, read by eye; no clade names are printed. Polytomies: Delapparentia-Kukufeldia-Lanzhousaurus-Barilium-the rest, Proa-Iguanodon-the rest, and the seven-way node from Xuwulong to the "Probactrosaurus" mazongshanens clade (Xuwulong, Equijubus, Altirhinus, Ouranosaurus, Hypselospinus, the Mantellisaurus pair and the rest). 43 tips, 3 polytomies (5, 3, 7 children). Sample 6 case (census 2 extended to draw 120, seed 20261231). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

